error[E1200]: type mismatch
 --> tests/cirkalang/fail/type/borrow_escape.cirka:9:27
  |
9 |   case borrow arr as a in pure a of
  |                           ^^^^^^
  = note: expected `Borrow (Unique (UArray Int)) r _`
  = note:    found `Borrow (Unique (UArray Int)) r (Ref (Unique (UArray Int)) r)`
  = note: the region `r` exists only inside the borrow or `withRegion` that binds it, so neither a reference into it nor a computation in it can be the result
  = help: return a value read through the reference instead (spec-v0.0.3.md §2.1, §3.1)
